# Formulario UI

Read `DESIGN.md` before changing layout, styling, or components. Match existing screens. Do not invent a new look.

- Calm, dense, formula-first. Chat is secondary.
- Reuse `AppShell`, `PageHeader`, `Card`, `Button`, `EmptyState`, `FieldGroup`, `StatusBadge`.
- Semantic tokens only (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `text-warning`). No raw Tailwind colors for status.
- No decorative card/empty/dialog hairlines; separate surfaces with fill, `shadow-soft`, and gap. Keep form, table, focus, and badge borders.
- `gap-*` not `space-y-*`. Lucide icons. Copy through i18n (en, fr, it).
- One primary button per cluster. Empty/locked/paid-gap states stay in the same layout.
- Check light and dark, and a narrow screen.

If you add a pattern we will reuse, update `DESIGN.md`.
